<Base title="Thank you — Vermont School Budgets" description="Your budget document was received.">
  <h1>Thank you</h1>
  <p class="lede">We received your document.</p>
  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A person checks the document and the details you gave about where it came from.</li>
    <li>Once it passes that check, it is added to the site. That is not instant; it can take a few days.</li>
    <li>If you gave an email address, we may write to ask a question. We never publish it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If something is wrong with it, we may not be able to use it. You are welcome to send it again, or send a different
    copy. <a href="/contribute/">Send another document</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
